            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### New

- A collection folder's hero video now plays on the Mac, iPhone and iPad as
  well as Apple TV. It plays once, muted, over the folder's backdrop and then
  fades back to the still picture, instead of looping behind the title.
- A folder that has a hero video no longer loops its cover animation over the
  backdrop afterwards.
]]></description>
